Sire’s Hollow Library

[en.FOCUS_C09_SH_LIBRARY_desc]
“This is Antiquity section, no pony ever comes back here.”\n“There you are!”\n— Relax, we have also introduced some modern books, such as “Equestrian History”, “West Equestrian History”, “Sire’s Hollow History”, etc.

[zh.FOCUS_C09_SH_LIBRARY]
名流谷图书馆

[zh.FOCUS_C09_SH_LIBRARY_desc]
“这里是古代区，从来没有小马来过。”\n“你好啊！”\n—— 放心吧，现在也引进了一些现代的新书，比如《小马利亚通史》，《西小马利亚通史》，《名流谷通史》等。

